(116, 'ELECTROWEB', 'Electroweb', 'ELECTRIC', 'Special', 55, 95, 15, 'AllNearFoes', 'LowerTargetSpeed1', 'CanProtect,CanMirrorMove', 0, 100, 'The user captures and attacks foes by using an electric net, which lowers their Speed stat.'),
