(130, 'FLEURCANNON', 'Fleur Cannon', 'FAIRY', 'Special', 130, 90, 5, 'NearOther', 'LowerUserSpAtk2', 'CanProtect,CanMirrorMove,CannotMetronome', 0, 0, 'The user unleashes a strong beam. The attack''s recoil harshly lowers the user''s Sp. Atk stat.'),
(131, 'MISTYEXPLOSION', 'Misty Explosion', 'FAIRY', 'Special', 100, 100, 5, 'AllNearOthers', 'UserFaintsPowersUpInMistyTerrainExplosive', 'CanProtect,CanMirrorMove', 0, 0, 'The user attacks everything around and faints upon using this move. Power increases on Misty Terrain.'),
