(133, 'PLAYROUGH', 'Play Rough', 'FAIRY', 'Physical', 90, 90, 10, 'NearOther', 'LowerTargetAttack1', 'Contact,CanProtect,CanMirrorMove', 0, 10, 'The user plays rough with the target and attacks it. This may also lower the target''s Attack stat.'),
