(135, 'DAZZLINGGLEAM', 'Dazzling Gleam', 'FAIRY', 'Special', 80, 100, 10, 'AllNearFoes', 'None', 'CanProtect,CanMirrorMove', 0, 0, 'The user damages opposing Pokémon by emitting a powerful flash.'),
