(150, 'MISTYTERRAIN', 'Misty Terrain', 'FAIRY', 'Status', 0, 0, 10, 'BothSides', 'StartMistyTerrain', NULL, 0, 0, 'The user covers the ground with mist for five turns. Grounded Pokémon can''t gain status conditions.'),
