(152, 'SWEETKISS', 'Sweet Kiss', 'FAIRY', 'Status', 0, 75, 10, 'NearOther', 'ConfuseTarget', 'CanProtect,CanMirrorMove', 0, 0, 'The user kisses the target with a sweet, angelic cuteness that causes confusion.'),
