(154, 'METEORASSAULT', 'Meteor Assault', 'FIGHTING', 'Physical', 150, 100, 5, 'NearOther', 'AttackAndSkipNextTurn', 'CanProtect,CanMirrorMove,CannotMetronome', 0, 0, 'The user attacks wildly with its thick leek. The user can''t move on the next turn.'),
