(161, 'FLYINGPRESS', 'Flying Press', 'FIGHTING', 'Physical', 100, 95, 10, 'Other', 'EffectivenessIncludesFlyingType', 'Contact,CanProtect,CanMirrorMove,TramplesMinimize', 0, 0, 'The user dives down onto the target from the sky. This move is Fighting and Flying type simultaneously.'),
