(163, 'JUMPKICK', 'Jump Kick', 'FIGHTING', 'Physical', 100, 95, 10, 'NearOther', 'CrashDamageIfFailsUnusableInGravity', 'Contact,CanProtect,CanMirrorMove', 0, 0, 'The user jumps up high, then strikes with a kick. If the kick misses, the user hurts itself.'),
