(182, 'MACHPUNCH', 'Mach Punch', 'FIGHTING', 'Physical', 40, 100, 30, 'NearOther', 'None', 'Contact,CanProtect,CanMirrorMove,Punching', 1, 0, 'The user throws a punch at blinding speed. It is certain to strike first.'),
