(251, 'PLUCK', 'Pluck', 'FLYING', 'Physical', 60, 100, 20, 'Other', 'UserConsumeTargetBerry', 'Contact,CanProtect,CanMirrorMove', 0, 0, 'The user pecks the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect.'),
