(481, 'CAMOUFLAGE', 'Camouflage', 'NORMAL', 'Status', 0, 0, 20, 'User', 'SetUserTypesBasedOnEnvironment', NULL, 0, 0, 'The user''s type is changed depending on its environment, such as at water''s edge, in grass, or in a cave.'),
