(517, 'MIMIC', 'Mimic', 'NORMAL', 'Status', 0, 0, 10, 'NearOther', 'ReplaceMoveThisBattleWithTargetLastMoveUsed', 'CanProtect', 0, 0, 'The user copies the move last used by the foe. The move can be used until the user is switched out.'),
